kit comes in a rustic cotton bag, and comes complete with an exclusive <strong>O'Donnell Enamel Christmas Mug<\/strong>, vegan friendly marshmallows and a serving suggestion card. <\/p><p>Tough Nut, our most popular flavour of moonshine, has a rich flavour of <strong>hazelnuts<\/strong>, smooth caramel and velvety nougat complemented by a dash of barrel-aged whiskey. Perfect for evoking winter warmth and Christmas cheer!<\/p>","page":""}},"32b786d6-269a-4f91-b1c1-1127d452915e":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"306ee80a-abbf-4074-92bc-03e3130ac128":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","d4344a40-1c5b-400c-ae8f-fcdc24a5ef97","caption","price","variant_picker","92509ddc-3ec2-4529-b160-6e1da5dc9927","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","bffe66cd-99d4-43eb-acd0-9850f187e77f","wishlist_engine_product_page_QytAk7","description","collapsible-row-0","32b786d6-269a-4f91-b1c1-1127d452915e","306ee80a-abbf-4074-92bc-03e3130ac128","collapsible-row-2"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":false,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enab